@jsafrane The code snippet that you linked (and the handling of volumes in the uncertain state) applies to volume plugins that implement the `volume.CustomBlockVolumeMapper` interface:
https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/9e991415386e4cf155a24b1da15becaa390438d8/pkg/volume/util/operationexecutor/operation_generator.go#L993

I don't think that holds true for the in-tree GCP PD plugin or other plugins that don't implement this interface.
